  {
   "id": "note-lbl88",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 174,
   "y": 1545,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`x [T, 6144] → next layer`"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-kv",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": -116,
   "width": 520,
   "height": 130,
   "text": "Why MLA: the cache keeps one 512+64 latent per token instead of 64 heads × (256+256) keys and values (32,768 numbers); kv_b_proj re-expands it. Full layers also cache a 128-dim indexer key."
  }
